[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:23.20]Chhod ke mahal-chubare raja, ban gaya jogi aaj re,
[00:30.80]Urvashi bijli ban ke udgi, tootta sakal samaj re!
[00:53.60]Teen vachan ki dori tooti, Kharoshthi ki rekha...
[01:01.20]Nagn dekh liya Apsara ne, Pururava ne maut ko dekha!
[01:16.40]Akhand-Siddham! Akhand-Siddham!
[01:24.00]9 Lipiyon ka jaal hai, O.I. (Original Intelligence) ka kaal hai!
[01:31.60]Tathastu! Tathastu! Tathastu!
[01:46.80]Mullai nilam viraham... Urvashi maraivu...
[01:54.40]Pururava-vin thuyaram, akshara-sara sangamam!
[02:17.20]...Siddham.
